      "message": "I don\u0027t think we should take the suggested change to CtsNetUtils. See inline.\n\nAlso, I\u0027m not sure we should keep this file at all, since this test does not seem to be well-written. Chiachang: I think you spent a fair bit of time making ConnectivityManagerTest#testSetAirplaneMode correct and reliable, right? Can we use that test instead and just delete this one? Is there anything this test does that that one does not do?\n\nEven if there is, then we\u0027re probably better off deleting this test entirely and improving ConnectivityManagerTest#testSetAirplaneMode.\n\n-2ing this CL since I think a better approach would be to delete this file and, if there is anything tested in this file that is not tested by ConnectivityManagerTest#testSetAirplaneMode, to add it there instead.",
